            <note corresp="#d136-f1" n="73" xml:id="d136-f1-content">
                <p>List copied from a 5-volume history by Bernadotte B.
                    Schmitt, “The United Nations Conference on International
                    Organization” (mimeographed, Department of State, 1948), vol. <hi
                        rendition="#small-caps">i</hi>, p. 22. The names crossed out on this list
                    are those of countries appearing in the list contained in the memorandum of
                    April 3 to the British Embassy, <ref target="#pg181">p. 181</ref>, which were
                    replaced by the names of countries underlined in this new list.</p>
            </note>
